# Dependencies
node_modules/

# Build outputs
dist/
build/
.next/
out/

# Environment & secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
# Phien dang nhap zca-js (cookie/imei/userAgent) + ma QR — la session token, KHONG commit
secrets/
# Ho so khao sat khach hang — PII THAT (dia chi, SDT, PO, STK, bang gia) — KHONG commit len GitHub.
# Dung cuc bo de nap nguon su that; da trich vao apps/api/src/knowledge/seed.ts.
docs/khach-hang/*/nguon-goc/ho-so-khao-sat/
# TAI LIEU GOC CUA KHACH — moi dinh dang nhi phan trong vung `nguon-goc/`.
#
# Dong tren chi chan mot THU MUC CON, va do la du de mot ho so khao sat that (co ten nguoi lien he
# va so dien thoai) nam ngay canh no trong suot mot thoi gian — repo nay PUBLIC. Byte goc cua khach
# thuoc ve kho rieng; repo giu SHA-256 va metadata. Xem:
#   docs/phat-trien/van-hanh/nguon-khach-hang.md
#   tools/customer-source-guardrail/  (cong thi hanh o CI)
docs/khach-hang/*/nguon-goc/**/*.docx
docs/khach-hang/*/nguon-goc/**/*.doc
docs/khach-hang/*/nguon-goc/**/*.pdf
docs/khach-hang/*/nguon-goc/**/*.xlsx
docs/khach-hang/*/nguon-goc/**/*.xls
# Vung lam viec rieng trong repo — chi duoc ton tai neu duoc gitignore (uu tien de NGOAI repo).
.customer-sources/

# BAN BUILD cua mau A4 gui khach — sinh tu tools/excel-template/generate_a4_template.py.
#
# Ban truoc duoc COMMIT, va do la mot ro ri that: no chua ba ten dai ly va HAI CHAT ID NHOM ZALO
# lay tu khao sat (chinh sheet huong dan cua no ghi "du lieu that tu khao sat"), trong mot repo
# PUBLIC. Ghim SHA-256 chi chung minh "van la dung tep do" — no khong chung minh tep do an toan.
# Mot ro ri on dinh van la mot ro ri.
#
# Gio: generator sinh du lieu VI DU tong hop, ban build khong vao git, va bai test cua importer
# dung fixture rieng tai apps/api/src/settings/__fixtures__/.
docs/khach-hang/*/trao-doi/*.xlsx
docs/khach-hang/*/trao-doi/*.xls
docs/khach-hang/*/trao-doi/*.docx
docs/khach-hang/*/trao-doi/*.doc

# Logs
*.log
logs/

# Database
*.sqlite
*.db
apps/api/data/

